      "content": "I'll start by reading both the original test and the CUT source.Now I have a clear picture of the original test. I'll improve it by:\n1. Removing unused imports and methods (only `testCopy` is exercised)\n2. Replacing the invalid generic `T` with `SparseBloomFilter`\n3. Removing the un-compilable `__super_createEmptyFilter` stub\n4. Adding a focused comment explaining what the test verifiesThe improved test compiles successfully. The refactored file removes unused imports and helper methods, replaces the invalid generic `T` with the concrete `SparseBloomFilter` type, eliminates the non-compilable `__super_createEmptyFilter` stub, and adds a clear Javadoc comment explaining exactly what `testCopy` verifies."
